---
import PrimaryLayout from '../layouts/PrimaryLayout.astro';
import HomepagePrototype from '../components/HomepagePrototype.astro';

---

<style>



</style>

{import.meta.env.DEV ? <HomepagePrototype /> : <PrimaryLayout>

    <h1 class="col-span-full grid items-center justify-center text-5xl font-glyphic">Ethan Greentree, Professional Tinkerer</h1>


    <main class="row-span-11 col-span-full items-center justify-center text-5xl font-glyphic">

      <h2>I wanted to know how it works. So I built one</h2>

      <p>Hey, I'm Ethan, a programmer, professional tinkerer, and facilitator who enjoys figuring out how things work and turning curiosity into action.</p>


    </main>

    <section>

      <h2>I have a lot of questions</h2>

      <p>How does this work? Why does it work that way? Can we make it easier? What happens if...?</p>

    </section>

    <section>

      <h2>How I work</h2>

      <p>I like technology as a means rather than an end. Sometimes the answer might be Laravel, other times, it might be PowerShell. 
        Sometimes it's a spreadsheet or diagram that outlines the process and steps to explore the problem differently.</p>

    </section>

    <section>

      <h2>A little about me</h2>

      <p>I'm curious by default. I've spent the last 5 years working in the depths of programming, 
        IT administration, server creation, virtual machine managing, data restoring and otherwise solving problems.</p>

      <p>
        I like understanding complicated things, breaking them into pieces and assembling them into a solution for a project. Personally a firm beliver in teaching as practice, if I find something interesting, I want others to know about it to!
      </p>

    </section>

    <section>

      <!-- Misc -->
      Happiest when something finally clicks

      Comfortable figuring things out


    </section>

    

</PrimaryLayout>}
